meanings
  source-authoring-grammar
    defined-by relation
    definition "Finite source-description forms bind an entire authoring operation and its destination to a generated declaration in the same language grammar."
    precondition "Every byte of the request is consumed by one registered full form; path, identifier, technical type and numeric value match the declaration exactly; identifier and numeric domains are valid; explicit quoted literal ownership is handled before this contract."
    effect "Produces conditional source spans and a declaration correspondence. Additional read-first, no-write, registration, deployment or future-work clauses do not match a source-only form and retain their independent authority. No import initialization, caller effects or compilation result is certified."
    source "js/agentic/code_task.mjs sha256=2feb348085e1b5b45a6484f71bf719cdab06c6868d0b4ea1f3afeecfa1fe0f20"
    source "rust/src/agentic_coding/code_task.rs sha256=ff8c8b70fa7c6491f0e919fca4eec70acc79806c34c52df6249113b8c7dd3cf9"
    unit "request offsets are UTF16 in JavaScript and UTF8 in Rust"
    example "A renamed public zero-argument i64 function or a named f64 division function can match a whole source-authoring form."
    source "js/agentic/code_task/source_contract/matcher.mjs sha256=2ff1bef0ffc630981fac5a06e9690bb57d72414e0812e4778eed963848b586c5"
    source "rust/src/agentic_coding/code_task/source_contract/matcher.rs sha256=28fcc8ce3a8d69c63565bec8c553d6023ab8ccb2baea796a8edc850b0e87328b"
    source "data/seed/source-authoring-grammar.lino sha256=c7a3222d4a252e71b2b5afb8a1a65c4c35201c87111d4bd3d3281b10607c235d"
    lexeme en
      word "source authoring grammar"
    lexeme ru
      word "грамматика создания исходного кода"
    lexeme hi
      word "स्रोत लेखन व्याकरण"
    lexeme zh
      word "源码编写语法"
    lexeme es
      word "gramática de creación de código fuente"
  float-division
    defined-by relation
    definition "One public Rust function takes one f64 parameter and returns that same parameter divided by an explicitly requested decimal f64 literal."
    precondition "The source declaration returns f64, its division operand is its declared parameter, and the denominator parses as finite and nonzero. The complete source-description form binds the requested name, destination, parameter type and denominator exactly."
    effect "Permits a reversible source draft through the existing target-preimage and literal-ownership guards; physical write/read receipts and native compilation remain separate obligations."
    unit "IEEE754 binary64 operand and denominator"
    example "A requested divisor changes the generated expression only when the source and request contracts agree."
    lexeme en
      word "floating point division"
    lexeme ru
      word "деление чисел с плавающей точкой"
    lexeme hi
      word "फ्लोटिंग पॉइंट विभाजन"
    lexeme zh
      word "浮点除法"
    lexeme es
      word "división de punto flotante"
  source-registration-composition
    defined-by relation
    definition "A registered finite form composes a fully source-qualified declaration operation with an explicit module registration action and its separately owned destination."
    precondition "The entire request must be consumed; the declaration has an existing valid identifier, numeric and exact technical-token contract; the registration destination is a different safe relative Rust path and the derived source basename is a valid Rust module identifier. All independent immutable requirements remain bound before effects."
    effect "Returns a conditional two-operation span graph. A recognized prefix retains its unconsumed remainder and blocks writes. A complete graph may use the existing observed source-write, source-readback, registration-preimage, registration-write and registration-readback transaction; import initialization, tool effects and compilation remain separate unknowns."
    unit "JavaScript UTF16 spans and Rust UTF8 spans reference the complete original request; composition whitespace is ASCII."
    example "A renamed integer declaration or finite nonzero f64 division can be registered through a compatible seeded connective; a deployment or unknown future-work tail is retained and refuses premature delivery."
    source "js/agentic/code_task/source_contract/registration_contract.mjs sha256=f6d32c67a6825a5dd043d00c4565f41b5600e7b5bcb97a36a508aad973495e63"
    source "rust/src/agentic_coding/code_task/source_contract/registration_contract.rs sha256=ad61d2e0f70d8bea6e701ea2cc6a8ed2fbcd048d6a9dc324acfb2c275dad346c"
    source "data/seed/source-authoring-grammar.lino sha256=c7a3222d4a252e71b2b5afb8a1a65c4c35201c87111d4bd3d3281b10607c235d"
    lexeme en
      word "source and module registration composition"
    lexeme ru
      word "составление исходного кода и регистрации модуля"
    lexeme hi
      word "स्रोत और मॉड्यूल पंजीकरण संयोजन"
    lexeme zh
      word "源码与模块注册组合"
    lexeme es
      word "composición de fuente y registro de módulo"
  coding_source_authoring_contract_missing
    defined-by code
    role coding_source_authoring_contract_missing
    definition "A source-owned gap diagnosis when a recognized authoring request lacks a complete binding from all requested work to supported source and integration operations."
    precondition "Explicit edit and quoted literal ownership routes are considered first. The recognized semantic Rust declaration or registration request does not establish a complete supported source-description or composition contract for every required operation."
    effect "Renders the seed-owned localized final answer with Gap disposition and source-description-goal-coverage-unbound origin. It does not certify source writing, registration, compilation or deployment, and cannot be delivered as a grounded Finding. Independent operations retain their own effect and verification obligations."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "Missing source authoring contract: complete request remains unbound."
    source "js/agentic/code_task.mjs sha256=2feb348085e1b5b45a6484f71bf719cdab06c6868d0b4ea1f3afeecfa1fe0f20 handler=plan_verified_generated_source_step/planVerifiedGeneratedSourceStep"
    source "rust/src/agentic_coding/code_task.rs sha256=ff8c8b70fa7c6491f0e919fca4eec70acc79806c34c52df6249113b8c7dd3cf9 handler=plan_verified_generated_source_step/planVerifiedGeneratedSourceStep"
    source "data/seed/multilingual-responses-agentic-tools.lino sha256=2871c52d94ff808d922ae38454565dcff839ef569d6dffc807301155e8854ef6 record=response_coding_source_authoring_contract_missing_en"
